    "block_columns_text_y9T4Qr": {
      "type": "block-columns-text",
      "blocks": {
        "card_PiNipN": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Weightlifting Guide for Beginners: How to Start Weight Lifting",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Blog_Weightlifting_Guide.webp",
            "text": "<p>Starting weight lifting can feel like walking into a foreign country. Everyone seems to know the language, the gym equipment is unfamiliar, and there's a mountain of conflicting advice online. Here is the good news: the weightlifting basics are simple, and the basics are what build real strength.&nbsp;<br/><br/></p>",
            "button_label": "Discover More",
            "button_link": "shopify://blogs/news/how-to-start-weight-lifting-guide"
          }
        },
        "card_cWyh6i": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Dead Hang Challenge: Dead Hang Benefits & How to Improve Dead Hang Time",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Dead_Hang_Challenge_in_Power_Rack_and_Kettlebell_Holds.png",
            "text": "<p>Dead hang challenge becomes viral fitness test for content creators. They challenge some gym goers how long they can hang from a bar and shockingly some non-gym enthusiasts were able to do this challenge for a longer time.</p>",
            "button_label": "Discover More",
            "button_link": "shopify://blogs/news/dead-hang-challenge-benefits-and-how-to-improve-hang-time"
          }
        },
        "card_KapqmJ": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Building Power & Strength: Q&A with Darren Dawidiuk",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/blog_Building_Power_Strength.webp",
            "text": "<p>At Northern Gym Equipment, we believe that the right fitness equipment is important; the intention and goal behind your training is what truly delivers results. To help on your fitness journey, we talk with our athlete ambassadors, ranging from ex-professional rugby players to strength specialists and pregnancy fitness experts.<br/><br/></p>",
            "button_label": "Discover More",
            "button_link": "shopify://blogs/news/building-power-strength-qa-with-darren-dawidiuk"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "card_PiNipN",
        "card_cWyh6i",
        "card_KapqmJ"
      ],
