          "settings": {
            "question": "Which gym equipment is best for losing weight and burning calories?",
            "answer": "<p>If you want to burn calories, it’s all about the intensity. We’re talking HIIT and heavy compound sets to keep the metabolic fire burning long after you’ve finished your session. Northern <a href=\"/products/northern-competition-sandbag-power-bag\" title=\"Northern Competition Sandbag Power Bag (5kg - 20kg)\"><strong>High-Density Power Bags</strong></a> and <a href=\"/collections/plyo-boxes\" title=\"PLYO BOXES\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Plyo Boxes</strong></span></a> are built for those full-body workouts that pushes your heart rate. To lose more weight, work harder with strength training routines using <a href=\"/products/hex-dumbbells\" title=\"Northern Hex Dumbbells (1kg - 50kg)\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Hex Dumbbells</strong></span></a> or <a href=\"/products/cast-iron-kettlebells\" title=\"Northern Cast Iron Kettlebells (2kg - 28kg)\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Cast Iron Kettlebells</strong></span></a>. With progressive weightlifting you can also lose weight, you need <a href=\"/collections/barbells\" title=\"Barbells\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Olympic barbells</strong></span></a> with a set of <a href=\"/products/olympic-bumper-plates-old\" title=\"Northern Olympic Bumper Plates\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>bumper plates</strong></span></a> or <a href=\"/products/cast-iron-plates-old\" title=\"Northern Olympic Cast Iron Plates\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>cast iron plates</strong></span></a> to work with multi-joint compound exercises including squats, presses and rows.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_XhngHg": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What gym equipment do I need to buy for a starter or new home gym setup?",
            "answer": "<p>Building your first home gym setup? A <a href=\"/products/5-15kg-hex-dumbbell-set-5-15kg-2-5kg-increments\" title=\"5-15KG Hex Dumbbell Set (2.5KG Increments)\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>set of hex dumbbells</strong></span></a>, a few <a href=\"/collections/kettlebells\" title=\"KETTLEBELLS\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>kettlebells</strong></span></a>, and our <a href=\"/collections/benches\" title=\"BENCHES\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>adjustable bench</strong></span></a> are the non-negotiables—offering hundreds of exercise variations in a compact space. Don't forget to protect your floor and reduce the noise with our <a href=\"/collections/floormats\" title=\"FLOORMATS\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>floor mats</strong></span></a> for those high-energy sets. If you’re more on yoga or Pilates, our <a href=\"/products/northern-4mm-yoga-mat\" title=\"Northern 4mm Yoga Mat Non-Slip, Eco-Friendly Exercise Mat, Pilates & Home Workouts\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>non-slip yoga mats</strong></span></a> will keep you stable and protected. For more serious workouts, that’s where our <a href=\"/products/northern-half-rack\" title=\"Northern Half Rack Heavy-Duty Strength Rack Station for Home & Commercial Gym\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Northern Half Rack</strong></span></a> and <a href=\"/collections/barbells\" title=\"BARBELLS\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Olympic bars</strong></span></a> is best.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_tKJ39f": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What gym equipment is best for core and ab training?",
            "answer": "<p>To build core stability, combine isometric exercises and high-intensity movements. The Tyre Wheel <a href=\"/products/northern-tyre-wheel-abdominal-exercise-ab-roller\" title=\"Northern Tyre Wheel Abdominal Exercise Ab Roller\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ab Roller</strong></span></a> is the go-to for that deep, functional burn, while <a href=\"/collections/gym-ab-mats\" title=\"Ab Mats & Balance Pads\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ab Mats</strong></span></a> and <a href=\"/products/northern-old\" title=\"Northern Foam Balance Pad\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Balance Pads</strong></span></a> provide the support you need to focus on the reps, not the floor. To build explosive rotational power and a core that actually performs, go with <a href=\"/collections/slamballs\" title=\"SLAM BALLS\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Slam Balls</strong></span></a> or <a href=\"/collections/kettlebells\" title=\"KETTLEBELLS\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Kettlebells</strong></span></a>. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_DNBWw4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How to properly clean your gym equipment and maintain?",
            "answer": "<p>Wipe down the weights with a mild detergent to keep things hygienic, just skip the harsh chemicals that mess with the powder-coating on the racks or the rubber on the hex dumbbells. For <a href=\"/products/northern-45cm-foam-roller-black\" title=\"Northern 45cm Foam Roller - Black\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>foam rollers</strong></span></a> and <a href=\"/collections/floormats\" title=\"FLOORMATS\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>flooring mats</strong></span></a>, a damp cloth wipe is enough to keep them fresh. Store the dumbbells in the <a href=\"/collections/dumbbell-racks\" title=\"Dumbbell Storage Racks\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>storage holder rack</strong></span></a> after each session to prevent accidental drops that can damage your flooring. Make it a habit to check the bolts on your adjustable bench so it stays solid for the next big push, and always rack your weights when you’re done.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_rHRhG4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When can I expect my fitness equipment order to arrive?",
            "answer": "<p>We know you’re excited to start your training, so we aim for rapid delivery across the UK. Most orders land on your doorstep within 2-4 working days. Our cut off time for next day delivery is 3pm. We also offer collection in our warehouse. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"CONTACT\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>reach to us</strong></span></a> for additional help.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_Rh3nAy": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer wholesale for commercial gyms or fitness facilities?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we offer high-quality and durable commercial gym equipment in wholesale. Every piece of equipment is built using top-tier materials to ensure your members can focus on their progress, not the tools. <a href=\"/pages/whole-sale-gym-equipment\" title=\"WHOLESALE GYM EQUIPMENT\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Drop a message</strong></span></a> and talk with our sales team today.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
